{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Battle Angel Alita","Doc Ido, a doctor and mechanic who lives and works in the hellish, postapocalyptic \"Scrapyard\", finds the&mdash;miraculously preserved&mdash;remains of a female cyborg in a junk heap. After he revives and rebuilds her, the preternaturally strong, amnesiac \"Gally\" begins to forge a life for herself in a world where every day can bring a fight for life. Adapts the first two volumes of the \"Battle Angel Alita\" manga."],"ja":["銃夢",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1016","ids":{"shikimori":1016,"mal":1016,"anilist":1016,"kodik":"serial-65636"},"kodikIds":["movie-64725","movie-64726","serial-15005","serial-65636"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-64725":"2020-11-27T13:12:30Z","movie-64726":"2020-11-27T13:12:54Z","serial-15005":"2019-12-14T07:54:06Z","serial-65636":"2025-03-08T05:39:35Z"},"title":"Боевой ангел Алита","originalTitle":"Battle Angel","alt":"Боевой Ангел Алита / Hyper Future Vision: Gunnm","description":"Дайскэ Идо — врач и механик, который живёт и работает на постапокалиптической Свалке. Однажды где-то в глубинах Свалки он находит останки девушки-киборга. После того как он оживляет и перестраивает её, невероятно сильная, страдающая амнезией Гали начинает ковать свою жизнь в мире, где каждый день происходит борьба за жизнь. Адаптация первых двух томов манги « Боевой ангел Алита ».","year":1993,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Драма","Фантастика","меха"],"rating":7.07,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1016/c5ac561c1fff969da135db2339499405.jpeg","width":555,"height":755},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/1016-37MErq5y5hRp.jpg","width":1900,"height":600}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":